<title>USA: Guaranty Federal sets semi-annual div.</title>
<headline>Guaranty Federal sets semi-annual div.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Mo. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guaranty Federal Savings Bank said Friday its board has approved a semi-annual dividend of $0.20 a share on 3,125,000 common shares.</p>
<p>It said the dividend will be paid on May 30 to stockholders of record on May 2. The dividend is the fourth consecutive semi-annual dividend it has declared, the company said.</p>
</text>
